Subject: [PATCH] qasf: Return S_OK from process_output when needs more input.

CW-Bug-Id: #21303
CW-Bug-Id: #21304
CW-Bug-Id: #23630
CW-Bug-Id: #24374
CW-Bug-Id: #24857
(cherry picked from commit a8423de19235d3b9099aac314489668172f56459)
---
 dlls/qasf/dmowrapper.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dlls/qasf/dmowrapper.c b/dlls/qasf/dmowrapper.c
index f6e586d0235..ef6409181ed 100644
--- a/dlls/qasf/dmowrapper.c
+++ b/dlls/qasf/dmowrapper.c
@@ -331,6 +331,8 @@ static HRESULT process_output(struct dmo_wrapper *filter, IMediaObject *dmo)
         release_output_samples(filter);
     } while (more_data);
 
+    if (hr == S_FALSE)
+        return S_OK;
     return hr;
 }
 
